{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The house you are sitting in right now is\nvery likely the biggest thing you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4261,
    "dDurationMs": 2941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "own. You worked for years to pay it off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7702,
    "dDurationMs": 4521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You raised a family in it, or grew old in\nit, and somewhere along the way you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12223,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decided it was finally safe. It is yours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 16023,
    "dDurationMs": 5702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nobody can take it now. But that is not\nquite true, and it is the reason I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21725,
    "dDurationMs": 5961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "am making this video. Every single year,\nolder people lose the very home they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27686,
    "dDurationMs": 3621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "already own. Not because they wanted to\nsell it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31487,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not because they did anything wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34047,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They lose it slowly. To a property tax\nbill that keeps climbing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39108,
    "dDurationMs": 1721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To an insurance bill that doubles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41489,
    "dDurationMs": 3141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To a loan that sounded like a good idea at\nthe time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45110,
    "dDurationMs": 4621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in some cases, to a thief who never\nonce sets foot on the porch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50411,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is the cruelest part of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52311,
    "dDurationMs": 4881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For nearly every one of these, there was\nhelp sitting right there that could"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57192,
    "dDurationMs": 3761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have stopped it, and no one ever told them\nit was there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61253,
    "dDurationMs": 5962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are five of them. Five ways the home\nyou own can be taken out from under"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67215,
    "dDurationMs": 5461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you. I want you to know every one of them\nby name, because the danger you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72676,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "name is the danger you can stop."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75576,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let us take them one at a time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78697,
    "dDurationMs": 5461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first one is the bill that has quietly\nforced more older people out of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84158,
    "dDurationMs": 5461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their paid off homes than almost anything\nelse, and that is your property tax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90520,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the cruel thing about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93080,
    "dDurationMs": 5561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can own your home free and clear, owe\nnot one penny to a bank, and still"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98641,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "lose it, because the property tax never\nstops coming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103102,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it climbs every year as your home is\nvalued higher, even while your income"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108003,
    "dDurationMs": 5922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stays flat. For someone living on a fixed\ncheck, a tax bill that grows from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113925,
    "dDurationMs": 4601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "two thousand dollars to five thousand over\nthe years can become the thing that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118526,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "finally breaks them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120486,
    "dDurationMs": 4541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But most people have never heard of the\none program that can stop it completely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125827,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is called a property tax deferral."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128828,
    "dDurationMs": 5461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In most states, once you reach a certain\nage, usually sixty five, you can ask"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134289,
    "dDurationMs": 2581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the state to simply pause your property\ntax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137410,
    "dDurationMs": 4401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You pay nothing now. The state covers the\nbill for you and waits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142491,
    "dDurationMs": 4401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You keep living in your home, year after\nyear, without paying that tax out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146892,
    "dDurationMs": 3681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your own pocket at all. The bill does\nnot vanish."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151133,
    "dDurationMs": 5541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It waits quietly until the day you sell\nthe home or pass it on, and then it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156674,
    "dDurationMs": 4321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is settled out of the value of the house,\nusually with only a small amount"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160995,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of interest added."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163035,
    "dDurationMs": 1721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think about what that really means."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165916,
    "dDurationMs": 4441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead of lying awake every autumn,\nafraid that this is the year the tax bill"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170357,
    "dDurationMs": 4861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "finally forces you out the door, you pay\nnothing, you stay in your own home,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175698,
    "dDurationMs": 4301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the bill simply waits in the\nbackground until the house is one day sold"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179999,
    "dDurationMs": 5961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or passed down. For a great many older\npeople, that single program is the one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185960,
    "dDurationMs": 4841,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thing standing between them and losing\neverything they spent a lifetime building."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191782,
    "dDurationMs": 4561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For an older person being squeezed out of\na home they already own, this can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196343,
    "dDurationMs": 2440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "be the difference between staying and\nleaving."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199403,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The call that starts it is to your county\ntax office, and the question is simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205064,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you have a property tax deferral for\nseniors, and how do I apply."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 209886,
    "dDurationMs": 4601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second one is a bill that has been\nclimbing faster than almost any other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214487,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the last few years, and that is your\nhomeowners insurance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219548,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you still have a mortgage, you are\nrequired to carry it, and even if your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224229,
    "dDurationMs": 5521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "home is fully paid off, losing it to a\nfire or a storm without insurance would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229750,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cost you everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231690,
    "dDurationMs": 5381,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you pay it, and you watch it rise,\nsometimes doubling in just a few years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237071,
    "dDurationMs": 4881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "until it begins to eat into the money you\nneed for food and for medicine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242313,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most people simply accept it and assume\nthere is nothing to be done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247234,
    "dDurationMs": 5641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is not true. There are several ways\nto bring that bill down that the insurance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252875,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "company will never once volunteer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256056,
    "dDurationMs": 4541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A great many insurers offer a discount for\nolder homeowners, or for people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260597,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who have stayed with them a long time, or\nwho have not filed a claim in years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265318,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you usually have to ask for it by\nname."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 268518,
    "dDurationMs": 4281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your bill has jumped, you have every\nright to shop it with other companies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272799,
    "dDurationMs": 5161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the price for the very same house\ncan differ far more than people realize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278180,
    "dDurationMs": 5021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if your area has become hard to insure\nat all, many states run what is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 283201,
    "dDurationMs": 4461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called a fair plan, a state backed option\nthat can cover you when the regular"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287662,
    "dDurationMs": 1101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "companies will not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289583,
    "dDurationMs": 5181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the call to make is to your own\ninsurance company first, to ask what discounts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 294764,
    "dDurationMs": 4941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you qualify for and to have them price\nyour policy again, and then to one or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299705,
    "dDurationMs": 1420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "two others to compare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301965,
    "dDurationMs": 5062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An afternoon on the phone can quietly save\nan older homeowner hundreds of dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307027,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a year. The third one is not a bill at\nall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310967,
    "dDurationMs": 5082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a deal that is sold to older people\nas a way to stay in their home, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 316049,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for some it quietly becomes the very thing\nthat costs them the home instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321830,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is called a reverse mortgage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324790,
    "dDurationMs": 4701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The pitch sounds wonderful. You are told\nyou can turn the value built up in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329491,
    "dDurationMs": 4861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your home into cash, live there for the\nrest of your life, and never make a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334352,
    "dDurationMs": 761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "monthly payment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335933,
    "dDurationMs": 4641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And for the right person, in the right\nsituation, it can be a fair tool."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340934,
    "dDurationMs": 4061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But here is what the friendly\nadvertisement does not make plain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 345695,
    "dDurationMs": 5441,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A reverse mortgage is still a loan against\nyour home, and it comes with rules"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351136,
    "dDurationMs": 3661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that can trip up an older person who was\nnever properly warned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355477,
    "dDurationMs": 4401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You are still required to keep paying your\nproperty taxes and your insurance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360438,
    "dDurationMs": 4461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to keep the home in good repair, and\nif you fall behind on any of those,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365199,
    "dDurationMs": 3641,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even by accident, the lender can begin to\ntake the home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369480,
    "dDurationMs": 4941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The debt also grows larger over time\ninstead of smaller, which can leave little"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374421,
    "dDurationMs": 3141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or nothing for the family you hoped to\npass it on to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377842,
    "dDurationMs": 5341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So before you ever sign one, sit down with\na housing counselor approved by"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 383183,
    "dDurationMs": 5341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the government, whose help is completely\nfree, and who works for you and not"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388524,
    "dDurationMs": 4901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the lender. They will walk you through\nwhether it is truly right for you,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393425,
    "dDurationMs": 5001,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what safer choices you may have,\nbefore you ever put the roof over your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398426,
    "dDurationMs": 5322,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "head on the line. The fourth one is for\nthe moment many older people fear the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403748,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most and almost never speak about, and\nthat is the moment you fall behind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409489,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe a health crisis drained your\nsavings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412449,
    "dDurationMs": 3941,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Maybe a husband or a wife passed away, and\nwith them went half the income,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416590,
    "dDurationMs": 1361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but not half the bills."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418911,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whatever the reason, you find yourself\nbehind on the mortgage, or behind on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422952,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that property tax, and the letters begin\nto arrive, and the worry keeps you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427873,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "awake at night. Here is what you must\nknow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431013,
    "dDurationMs": 4902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Falling behind does not mean you have\nalready lost, and reaching out early"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435915,
    "dDurationMs": 5461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "changes everything. The first place to\nturn is a housing counselor approved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441376,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by the government, and their help is\ncompletely free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445016,
    "dDurationMs": 4902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They will get on the phone with your\nlender for you, work out a plan, and know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449918,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about help you would never find on your\nown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452798,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They can often get a lender to pause your\npayments for a while, stretch them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456839,
    "dDurationMs": 5061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "out over more time, or move what you owe\nonto the end of the loan, so you can"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461900,
    "dDurationMs": 2741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "catch your breath and stay right where you\nare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465281,
    "dDurationMs": 5361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lenders will often agree to these things\nwhen a counselor asks, even when they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470642,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would never offer the same to a frightened\nhomeowner calling in alone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475523,
    "dDurationMs": 5101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of those is called the Homeowner\nAssistance Fund, money set aside to help"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480624,
    "dDurationMs": 4481,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "homeowners who fell behind catch up on\ntheir mortgage, their property tax,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485425,
    "dDurationMs": 1100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even their insurance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487326,
    "dDurationMs": 5401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In some states that fund is still open,\nthough it is closing soon, so if this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492727,
    "dDurationMs": 4701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is you, the time to call is now, today,\nand not next month."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497768,
    "dDurationMs": 5821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The one thing you must never do is stay\nsilent out of shame and wait, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503589,
    "dDurationMs": 3341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the help begins to disappear once things\ngo too far."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507630,
    "dDurationMs": 3581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Reach out early, and you have every chance\nto keep your home."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511551,
    "dDurationMs": 5241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the fifth one is the strangest and the\nmost frightening of them all, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516792,
    "dDurationMs": 4101,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is a thief who steals your home without\never coming near it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521173,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is called home title theft."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523994,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is how it works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525974,
    "dDurationMs": 6021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A criminal forges your signature on a\ndocument, files it with the county, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531995,
    "dDurationMs": 3621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on paper makes it look as though your home\nnow belongs to them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536296,
    "dDurationMs": 4461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They can then try to borrow money against\nyour house, or even sell it, all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540757,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without you knowing a single thing, until\nthe collection notices, or the strangers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545438,
    "dDurationMs": 2081,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at your door, begin to appear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548399,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And older people are the favorite target."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551059,
    "dDurationMs": 4601,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Federal investigators found that while\nseniors were only a small share of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555660,
    "dDurationMs": 4541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people who reported this crime, they lost\nnearly half of all the money that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560201,
    "dDurationMs": 621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was stolen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561542,
    "dDurationMs": 5241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are chosen on purpose. An older\nperson who owns a home free and clear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566783,
    "dDurationMs": 4061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and who may not think to check the county\nrecords or their credit very often,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 570844,
    "dDurationMs": 5421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is exactly the kind of quiet, trusting\ntarget these criminals go looking for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 576825,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now here is the good news, and it will\ncost you nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 580886,
    "dDurationMs": 4541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not need to buy one of those\nservices you see advertised on television"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585427,
    "dDurationMs": 4741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that charge you every month, because those\ndo not actually stop the theft,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590728,
    "dDurationMs": 2761,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they only tell you after it has already\nhappened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594249,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your own county offers the very same\nwarning for free."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598550,
    "dDurationMs": 5121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Most county recorder offices now let you\nsign up for a property alert, so that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603671,
    "dDurationMs": 5321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the moment anyone files any document\nagainst your home, you get a notice right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608992,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "away and can stop it before any real harm\nis done."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613193,
    "dDurationMs": 2681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It takes about fifteen minutes to set up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616414,
    "dDurationMs": 5621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Call your county recorder, or look them up\nonline, and ask to sign up for property"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622035,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fraud alerts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623435,
    "dDurationMs": 4721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is free, and it is the single best lock\nyou can put on the home you worked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628156,
    "dDurationMs": 5021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your whole life for. This is general\ninformation to help you know what to ask"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633177,
    "dDurationMs": 5962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for, and it is not legal or financial\nadvice, because the exact rules are a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639139,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "little different in every state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641279,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is all five. And look at what they\nshare."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646060,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every one of them is quiet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648441,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every one of them is counting on you not\nknowing it is there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652802,
    "dDurationMs": 5421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And every single one of them can be\nstopped, if you move before it happens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658223,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "instead of after."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660523,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You do not have to handle all five today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664704,
    "dDurationMs": 4561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just pick the one that worried you the\nmost while you were sitting here, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669265,
    "dDurationMs": 5241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one that made you think, that could be me,\nand take care of that one this week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675266,
    "dDurationMs": 2981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Make the one call. Ask the one question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678847,
    "dDurationMs": 5301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is enough to begin. This is the home\nyou worked your whole life for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684648,
    "dDurationMs": 5142,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These walls held your family. Your whole\nlife is in the memories here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690430,
    "dDurationMs": 5921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of everything you own, this home may be\nthe one thing that is still truly yours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 697271,
    "dDurationMs": 4621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And keeping it that way, for as long as\nyou want to live in it, is worth an"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701892,
    "dDurationMs": 3181,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "afternoon of your time. You earned this\nhome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705533,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now go and keep it."
    } ]
  } ]
}
